The following components are derived from or inspired by Alertmanager:

- dispatch/ - Alert dispatching and aggregation logic
  Based on github.com/prometheus/alertmanager/dispatch
  
- service/inhibit/ - Alert inhibition rules
  Based on github.com/prometheus/alertmanager/inhibit
  
- service/silence/ - Silence management
  Based on github.com/prometheus/alertmanager/silence
  
- service/store/ - Alert storage
  Based on github.com/prometheus/alertmanager/provider/mem
  
- service/provider/ - Alert provider interface
  Based on github.com/prometheus/alertmanager/provider
  
- notify/ - Notification pipeline and stages
  Based on github.com/prometheus/alertmanager/notify
  
- pkg/limit/ - Rate limiting
  Based on github.com/prometheus/alertmanager/pkg/limit

